# Infra access notes — keep out of version control
SFM-WEBSERVER-ACCESS.md

# MQTT broker + topic — keep private so no one can publish fake data.
# Copy *_config.example.py → mqtt_config.py and fill in your own values.
mqtt_config.py
field-pi/mqtt_config.py
server-weather-page/mqtt_config.py

# Real systemd unit files pulled from a live deployment can leak a server
# username/home-directory path — keep local, don't publish. Example unit
# files with placeholders live in DEPLOYMENT.md instead.
server-weather-page/weather-receiver.service

# Weather receiver runtime artifacts (generated on the server, not source)
server-weather-page/*.db
server-weather-page/weather-history.html
server-weather-page/weather.html
server-weather-page/weather-widget.html

